        <UserObject label="" description="Reading order: three task steps (declare, admit, compute outside the commit), three independent binding proofs (bytes, identity, operation), independent acceptance feeding separate original-code and recovered-source capabilities, then fence, quarantine and continue, and the late-worker design challenge. Missing evidence blocks only its own claim, an unhealthy resource blocks its dependents, and ready independent work continues. Design specification only: the late-worker experiment and all future software acceptance checks are NOT RUN; execution-contracts.outline.md is the text outline." id="0"><mxCell/></UserObject>
