        <UserObject label="" tooltip="FENCE: Reject obsolete publication&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=fence`&#10;&#10;- Old generation or changed inputs then historical only&#10;- Keep artifact; refuse current acceptance/promotion&#10;- Re-key only affected dependency descendants&#10;- Collision discovery may reduce accepted coverage&#10;- Fencing does NOT prove a worker has stopped&#10;- Representation totals disjoint; capabilities overlap" link="execution-contracts.outline.md#fence" id="fence"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L4"><mxGeometry x="35" y="980" width="550" height="235" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
