        <UserObject label="" tooltip="QUARANTINE: Keep resources occupied&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=quarantine`&#10;&#10;- Expired lease / timeout is not safe resource release&#10;- Late or kernel-blocked worker may still access state&#10;- Release needs corroborated end of access + owner&#10;- Atomic local locks; PID identity alone is insufficient&#10;- Private replacement only on disjoint safe resources&#10;- Bound isolated storage probes; never block scheduler" link="execution-contracts.outline.md#quarantine" id="quarantine"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L4"><mxGeometry x="625" y="980" width="550" height="235" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
