        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Concrete design challenge, the late worker&#10;&#10;In the app: `?node=challenge-late-worker`&#10;&#10;Attempt A loses its lease while still writing. B runs on disjoint resources. A later submits a byte-perfect artifact.&#10;&#10;Expected: reject A’s stale publication; retain A’s resource quarantine; permit B only with complete independent inputs.&#10;&#10;Future proof: inject this race and inspect accepted-generation receipts, ownership events and B’s dependency manifest.&#10;&#10;Status: NOT RUN. This diagram defines the acceptance mechanism; it does not claim a scheduler, binding or recovery result exists.&#10;&#10;Failure lifecycle and control-plane recovery: resilience-contracts.svg, detailed future checks in the linked plan. In the app: `?node=exec-footer`" link="execution-contracts.outline.md#challenge-late-worker" id="challenge-late-worker"><mxCell style="group" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="L5"><mxGeometry x="35" y="1250" width="1730" height="215" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject>
